---
title: Filspresso Next - Invoice Rendering Sequence
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as Next.js (BFF)
    participant NEST as NestJS Backend
    participant J as Java Invoice Service
    participant PDF as OpenPDF Renderer
    participant SIG as SignatureStampRenderer
    participant FS as Signature Resource PNG

    B->>N: Click "Download Invoice"
    N->>NEST: GET api/orders/:orderId/invoice
    Note over N,NEST: Authorization header + cookie forwarded via BFF proxy

    NEST->>NEST: Verify order belongs to requesting account
    NEST->>NEST: Check service assertion scope (service-invoice:render)

    NEST->>J: POST /api/invoices/render
    Note over NEST,J: Request body: order data, account info, line items

    J->>PDF: Build invoice document
    PDF->>PDF: Render header, billing/shipping addresses
    PDF->>PDF: Render line item table (product, qty, unit, total)
    PDF->>PDF: Render subtotal, shipping, tax, currency conversion

    J->>SIG: addSignatureStamp(invoiceRequest)
    SIG->>FS: Load /public/images/filspresso-signature.png
    FS-->>SIG: Image bytes
    SIG->>SIG: Stamp signature at bottom of last page
    SIG-->>J: Rendered signature section

    J->>J: Finalize PDF document
    J-->>NEST: PDF bytes (application/pdf)

    NEST-->>N: PDF binary stream
    Note over NEST,N: Content-Type: application/pdf<br/>Content-Disposition: attachment

    N-->>B: Browser triggers file download
